n.","locale":"tr_TR"},{"value":"轻松设计和发布美观的响应式网站，无需编写任何代码。","locale":"zh_CN"},{"value":"不需撰寫任何程式碼，即可輕鬆設計和發佈美觀的自適應網站。","locale":"zh_TW"},{"value":"Разрабатывайте и публикуйте красивые адаптивные веб-сайты без необходимости написания кода.","locale":"ru_RU"},{"value":"Progettate e pubblicate in modo semplice stupendi siti Web dinamici senza scrivere alcuna riga di codice. ","locale":"it_IT"},{"value":"Diseñe y publique fácilmente atractivos sitios web adaptables sin tener que escribir una sola línea de código.","locale":"es_ES"}]}</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_es_ES"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_es</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_sk_SK"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_nb_NO"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_no</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_de_DE"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_de</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_hu_HU"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_en_GB"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_uk_UA"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_fr_FR"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_fr</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_en_AE"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_tr_TR"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_tr</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_en_IL"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_ko_KR"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials_kr</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tutorialsPage_ro_RO"><value>http://www.adobe.com/go/muse-tutorials</value></custom-entry><custom-entry key="tut